<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84954" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆-κμητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrought with much toil,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> epith. of iron (as distd. from copper), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.48
			</span></i>, al.: generally, <i>elaborate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θάλαμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.718
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑανοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1189
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,
				<i>laborious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.656.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					7.424
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>toiling hard,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιῆες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.173
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
